OL,3,GNEWSAHeat raises costs and cuts crop
OL,4,Ayields for farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Environment Minister Kirsten
OL,7,FMorel said the government was keen to
OL,8,Fspeak to farmers and could look at
OL,9,Freprioritising funds from its rural
OL,10,Fsupport scheme.
